OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'heartbroken' over woman's
OL,4,Asudden death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who died on
OL,7,FMonday said they were "heartbroken" by
OL,8,Fthe loss.
OL,10,FDonna Ann Reece, 38, from
OL,11,FNewcastle-under-Lyme, died at a house
OL,12,Fon Clayton Lane on Monday.
OL,14,F"We cannot come to terms with this,"
OL,15,Fher family said in a statement on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,18,FThey were being supported by specialist
OL,19,Fofficers and asked for privacy while
OL,20,Finvestigations continue.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
